  "method": "Two scripted 10-turn travel chats. All paths make one live Jev call per turn and include every call in usage and cost. Direct action sees all user messages and asks one of seven preference-sensitive actions. Full-history beliefs sees all user messages and asks three belief questions before BeliefLang rules dispatch one of the same seven mock tools. Belief snapshot sees only saved beliefs plus the new message and asks the same three belief questions before the same rules dispatch one mock tool. All action calls use local mocks; no travel service is contacted. The fixed intent threshold is 0.7 and preference threshold is 0.5. There are no assistant messages in this dataset. Preference labels are scored for the two belief paths only.",
